WEBVTT

00:12:28.142 --> 00:12:30.042
Hio inahitajika.

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:35.757
Lakini haiepukiki kua tutakua bilioni
mbili mpaka tatu zaidi.

00:12:35.757 --> 00:12:38.969
Hivyo unavyojadili na unavyopanga

00:12:38.969 --> 00:12:42.372
kwa rasilimali na nishati zinazohitajika
baadae,

00:12:42.372 --> 00:12:44.705
kwa wanadamu kwenye hii sayari,

00:12:44.705 --> 00:12:46.862
unatakiwa upange kwa bilioni 10

00:12:46.862 --> 00:12:49.012
Asante sana.

00:12:49.012 --> 00:12:55.098
(Makofi)